   "about": "Keeping people and machines safe has been my focus for many years. From commercial burner controls to multi-module Safety Controllers, the focus is always on safety. Providing deterministic safety functions while simultaneously ensuring the safety integrity is challenging and this requires top to bottom attention to detail. Safety, functionality, ease of use are all paramount. IEC61508 demands high expectations, and only attention to detail will ensure that these demands are met. Adopting and adapting to changing requirements requires insight and system architectures that readily  accommodate. These are strengths gained over years of experience.\n\nEmbracing new ideas and technology excites me. We live in an ever changing world, a world in which those slower to keep pace will lose business. \n",
